[DrvInst]
DrvInst=RICOH MP 401SPF PCL 6,Gestetner MP 401SPF PCL 6,infotec MP 401SPF PCL 6,LANIER MP 401SPF PCL 6,NRG MP 401SPF PCL 6,SAVIN MP 401SPF PCL 6
